---
title: Deterministic Reasoner — the pipeline annotates, it never deletes
---
flowchart TB
    IN["RequestConstraints<br/>typed, with confidences and source spans"]

    IN --> E["ENUMERATE<br/>grid slots x eligible providers<br/>3,348 slots -> ~13,000 candidates"]

    E --> PA["LAYER 0 — Phase A · slot-level rules<br/>hours · blocks · emergency hold · exclusions<br/>operatory free + turnover · held · equipment"]
    PA --> PB["LAYER 0 — Phase B · provider-level rules<br/>provider free · credentialed · on site<br/>doctor-check containment"]

    PA -. "annotate rejection_reason<br/>NEVER remove" .-> LEDGER["REJECTION LEDGER<br/>one stated cause per candidate"]
    PB -. "annotate rejection_reason<br/>NEVER remove" .-> LEDGER

    PB --> INV{"CONSERVATION INVARIANT<br/>feasible + sum(rejected) == enumerated"}
    INV -->|"holds"| T["LAYER 1 — URGENCY GATE<br/>lexicographic tiers, not a weight<br/>rank inside the most urgent tier that has candidates"]
    INV -->|"fails"| BOOM["assertion error<br/>the funnel would be lying"]

    T -->|"tier empty and urgency >= urgent"| ESC["ESCALATE<br/>release emergency holds -> labelled overflow<br/>never return nothing"]
    ESC --> S
    T --> S["LAYER 2 — SCORE<br/>axis matrix A (n x 4), computed once<br/>time fit · continuity · efficiency · prime time"]

    S --> W["score = A x effective weight vector<br/>re-rank is a product, not a re-run"]
    W --> R["RATIONALE emitted BY THE SCORER<br/>top components + facts + at most one caveat"]

    R --> SEL["SELECT<br/>tiebreak chain -> epsilon band -> diversity"]
    SEL --> OUT["TOP 3 OFFERS<br/>+ funnel · ledger · counterfactual"]
    R --> XP["EXPLAINER<br/>renders atoms only — cannot see the schedule"]
    XP --> OUT
    LEDGER --> OUT
